# 让 Windows / Linux 上开发的人检出后得到同样的文件
# 核心问题：Windows 的 CRLF 会让 diff 全是"改了又改回去"的噪音，
# 而 .bat 批处理在 Linux 上跑不起来，Dockerfile 用 CRLF 也会被 docker 拒绝。

# 默认：入库统一存 LF，检出时按平台自动转换
* text=auto eol=lf

# 必须保持 CRLF：Windows 批处理 / PowerShell
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 必须保持 LF：Shell 脚本、Docker 容器内文件
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.docx binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.db binary

# 语言统计用的 linguist 属性
*.js   linguist-language=JavaScript
*.ts   linguist-language=TypeScript
*.tsx  linguist-language=TypeScript
*.md   linguist-documentation
